ped questions; keep one answer row per question&lt;br/&gt;• Validate that StudentAnswer.QuestionId belongs to the same Quiz as QuizAttempt" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="900" y="40" width="330" height="170" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>